# 1. Ignore all files by default in all directories
*

# 2. Allow Git to traverse subfolders
!*/

# 3. Whitelist C++ source files and headers
!*.cpp
!*.h
!*.hpp
!*.c
!*.cxx

# 4. Whitelist essential repository configuration and metadata files
!.gitignore
!*.md
!*.txt
!*.json
!*.sh
!Makefile
!CMakeLists.txt
